{
  "$comment": "THTH の画面の部品の表（正本）。設計 docs/設計_THTH画面_MCPApps_2026-11-27.md §1-3。版を上げるときは version を変える。柵は tests/test_mcp_ui_catalog.py。remote_tools は段 K のリモート MCP（thth.me/mcp・callback/src/mcp-tools.js）の道具の名で、その画面を付ける物（第24 11/28 の決め (1)・作り手 tools/render_mcp_ui.py）",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "mimeType": "text/html;profile=mcp-app",
  "rules": [
    "画面の文は道具の結果（THTH の CLI の --json）から描く。AI が文を渡す口を作らない",
    "行動の引数の文字の欄は、列挙・形（pattern）・日時（format）・digest に縛られた写し（x-thth-bound-by-digest）のどれかに限る。digest に縛られた写しは 1 段目の結果から写し、画面で編集させない（2 段目でサーバが digest で照らすので、1 字でも変われば断られる）",
    "画面に対応しない client には何も足さない（tests/test_mcp_ui_fence.py）"
  ],
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "uri": "ui://thth/queue",
      "title": "予定の一覧",
      "weight": "light",
      "tools": [
        "thth_queue",
        "thth_board",
        "thth_draft_list"
      ],
      "shows": [
        "口座",
        "状態（draft・approved・予約・型外）",
        "出す時刻",
        "次に出るもの"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "filter",
          "calls": "thth_queue",
          "visibility": [
            "app"
          ],
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "account": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "open_preview",
          "calls": "thth_preview",
          "visibility": [
            "app"
          ],
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "file": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000]{1,1024}\\.md$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "file"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "wait_result",
          "calls": "thth_result",
          "remote": true,
          "visibility": [
            "app"
          ],
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "request_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{43}~[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,31}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "request_id"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "client_side": [
        "並べ替え（時刻・口座・状態）",
        "状態で絞る"
      ],
      "remote_tools": [
        "thth_board"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "preview",
      "uri": "ui://thth/preview",
      "title": "下見のカード",
      "weight": "light",
      "tools": [
        "thth_preview"
      ],
      "shows": [
        "宛先の口座",
        "日時",
        "本文（全文・省略しない）",
        "文字数と上限"
      ],
      "order": [
        "宛先の口座",
        "日時",
        "本文"
      ],
      "actions": [],
      "remote_tools": []
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm",
      "uri": "ui://thth/confirm",
      "title": "確定のカード",
      "weight": "heavy",
      "note": "画面で押した＝人が押した証明ではない。確かめはサーバの digest（文で 2 段目を頼むのと重さは同じ）",
      "tools": [
        "thth_retract_request",
        "thth_schedule_request",
        "thth_bookmark_request"
      ],
      "shows_when": "status が confirm_required か stage 1 の結果だけ",
      "shows": [
        "宛先の口座",
        "日時",
        "本文（全文・省略しない）",
        "URL",
        "理由（読むだけ・入力欄にしない）",
        "digest の頭 8 字"
      ],
      "order": [
        "宛先の口座",
        "日時",
        "本文",
        "URL",
        "理由",
        "digest"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "confirm",
          "calls": "thth_ui_confirm",
          "visibility": [
            "app"
          ],
          "description_note": "画面から押しても、人が押した証明にはならない。確かめは digest",
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "tool": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "thth_retract_request",
                  "thth_schedule_request",
                  "thth_bookmark_request"
                ]
              },
              "digest": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{12,128}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              },
              "account": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_:.-]{1,128}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true,
                "description": "post_id・draft_id など"
              },
              "reason": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 500,
                "x-thth-from-result": true,
                "x-thth-bound-by-digest": true,
                "description": "1 段目の結果の reason をそのまま写す。画面で編集させない"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "tool",
              "account",
              "target",
              "digest"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "open_questions": [
        "require_gate の口座では番号の欄を画面に置かない（今どおり AI が番号を付けて 2 段目を呼ぶ）"
      ],
      "readonly": [
        "理由"
      ],
      "decided": [
        "確定の引数は reason を 1 段目の結果から写す（控えは持たない）。digest が reason を含むので写し違いは 2 段目で confirm_mismatch（第24 11/27 #9961）"
      ],
      "remote_tools": []
    },
    {
      "id": "numbers",
      "uri": "ui://thth/numbers",
      "title": "数字の 1 枚",
      "weight": "light",
      "tools": [
        "thth_summary",
        "analytics_report",
        "thth_morning"
      ],
      "shows": [
        "公開数",
        "反応の和",
        "返していない返信の数",
        "フォロワーの差",
        "止まっているか",
        "期間・母数・欠測"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "window",
          "calls": "analytics_report",
          "visibility": [
            "app"
          ],
          "args": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "account": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}$",
                "x-thth-from-result": true
              },
              "window_days": {
                "type": "integer",
                "enum": [
                  7,
                  28,
                  90
                ]
              },
              "compare_previous": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "remote_tools": []
    }
  ]
}
